  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sOb6wz3.png\" width=\"656\" height=\"244\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;自1.21版本起，本模組將僅在NeoForge平台更新</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>模組介紹</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">「繽紛旅程」是一款著重世界生成的擴展模組，透過添加細緻環境細節讓原版生態域更生動鮮活！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HgsxmEN.png\" width=\"494\" height=\"540\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特色內容 (1.18+)</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>地表裝飾</strong>：探索時會發現<strong>岩石</strong>、<strong>樹枝</strong>、<strong>落葉堆</strong>、<strong>動物骨骸</strong>、<strong>松果</strong>、<strong>貝殼</strong>等豐富物件！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>活化生態域</strong>：新增<strong>高草叢變種</strong>、<strong>倒木</strong>、<strong>樹皮真菌</strong>與<strong>地獄植物群</strong>！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>湖泊升級</strong>：水域現在有<strong>海草</strong>、<strong>香蒲</strong>和<strong>荷葉</strong>點綴，告別單調景觀！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>沙灘美化</strong>：海岸線新增<strong>海濱草</strong>、<strong>貝殼堆</strong>與<strong>沙灘草叢</strong>裝飾！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>強化地獄遺跡</strong>：廢棄傳送門現在會生成靈魂砂、玄武岩、扭曲與緋紅四種主題變體！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>細節優化</strong>：樹葉下會生成<strong>蜘蛛網</strong>、叢林水域出現<strong>熱帶魚</strong>等精緻改動！</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XcGjKMc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"596\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yOUCkgQ.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BNYj5cS.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pAoqBqe.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/84eaff1e-d58c-4c2a-bf2a-5fcbd0f36c46.png\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>本模組採用<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby-nc-sa%252f4.0%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">創用CC 姓名標示-非商業性-相同方式分享 4.0 國際授權條款</a></strong></strong></p>",
